    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span></b>  (inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			), fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.339
				</span></i>
			, etc., 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾱσεῦμαι</span>”
